 "edit_policy": "Content unchanged. The only edits are import lines that name a mirrored module: the spend-path files import each other by root module names (R1NaturalProjection, ...), and on the build host those root names are already taken by other jobs' sources and .olean files under $T/sources and $T/objects2. The mirror lives under $T/sources/R1Mirror/ (module prefix R1Mirror.) so that it neither overwrites nor silently reuses another job's objects; each such import line is rewritten to the R1Mirror. name and listed in diff. No declaration, namespace, proof or option line is changed.",
